      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colona%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The city is located in Henry County, Illinois, about ten miles southeast of Moline and fifteen miles south of the Iowa border.",
